ulti-line duplicate values, blank-line filtering.\n- **`recordReview`** (the core write path) — needs integration coverage for all five branches:\n\n```ts\n// lib/server/conflicts.test.ts (integration — real/seeded test DB or repo-level mock)\ndescribe(\"recordReview\", () => {\n  it(\"404s when conflictId doesn't exist\", async () => { /* ... */ });\n  it(\"409s when nothing has been proposed yet (resolution null)\", async () => { /* mid-pipeline run */ });\n  it(\"409s on approve when proposedValue is empty (escalate rule fired)\", async () => { /* ... */ });\n  it(\"400s on override with a value that isn't observed and isn't a legal fold\", async () => { /* ... */ });\n  it(\"stores the OBSERVED form on override, not the raw typed string\", async () => { /* 'acme inc' -> 'Acme Corp' */ });\n  it(\"clears overrideValue when a reviewer approves after a previous override\", async () => { /* status transition */ });\n  it(\"never lets a client-supplied reviewedBy through — always uses the session reviewer\", async () => { /* ... */ });\n  it(\"appends exactly one audit_log row per review, with previousStatus set\", async () => { /* ... */ });\n  it.todo(\"never mutates proposedValue/rationale/confidence/appliedRuleId — the agent's proposal is immutable\");\n});\n```\n\n- **`lib/server/export.ts`**: `applyDecisions` (pure, exported — testable now), `loadOrphans` presence branch (same both-absent edge as above), `decisionsToCsv`/`csvCell` (pure, exported):\n\n```ts\ndescribe(\"decisionsToCsv / csvCell\", () => {\n  it(\"quotes a value containing a comma, quote, or newline\", () => { /* embedded '\"' -> doubled */ });\n  it(\"renders null as an empty cell, not the string 'null'\", () => { /* ... */ });\n  it(\"ends every line with CRLF, including the last\", () => { /* Excel-friendly */ });\n});\ndescribe(\"estimateExportBytes / getExportSizing\", () => {\n  it(\"sums only the requested sections, not all four\", () => { /* ... */ });\n});\n```\n\n- **`lib/server/ruleset